" Tridactyl runtime config.
" Reload after edits with `:source` or restart Firefox.

" Full reset on every source (Tridactyl 1.25.0+). Storage otherwise
" accumulates stale autocmds/subconfigs across `:source` runs forever --
" `:source` alone only adds/overwrites, never prunes.
sanitise tridactylconfig
set configversion 2.0

" --- Theme -------------------------------------------------------------

" Reads themes/catppuccin-mocha.css relative to this file (native messenger
" required). Local file, not --url, so it's version-controlled here and
" doesn't depend on network/GitHub uptime at every `:source`.
colourscheme catppuccin-mocha

" --- Site-specific passthrough ------------------------------------------

" Atlassian Cloud (Jira, Confluence): Tridactyl doesn't run here at all --
" no content-script injection, no key interception, nothing to fight with
" the site's own bindings (including `/` for its native search).
seturl atlassian.net superignore true

" Monkeytype needs raw keystrokes to type.
autocmd DocStart monkeytype.com mode ignore
